    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Two sites which may be suitable for the construction of two residential houses (subject to any necessary planning permission). Site B - 0.11 hectares / 0.27 acres. Site C - 0.13 hectares / 0.31 acres.\r\n\r\n€225,000 per site - as is, the sites are not being sold on a subject to planning basis"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The vendor has had a pre planning discussion with Limerick City and County Council which resulted in the following points being clarified:\r\n\r\nThe sites are located in lands zoned “existing residential”.\r\n\r\nThe construction of the dwelling at the above location is acceptable in principle subject to compliance with the following. \r\nSpecific planning policy requirements of the sustainable and compact settlement guidelines.\r\nSPPR1 - Separation distances - 16 metres between the opposing first floor windows. \r\nSPPR2 - Minimum private open space standards for houses.\r\nSPPR3 - Car parking. The site is considered an accessible location and therefore shall have a minimum 1.5 numbered parking spaces.\r\nSPPR4 - Cycle parking and storage. Given that the dwellings will be detached, side access to rear gardens is achievable, therefore bike parking and storage of bins should be to the rear.\r\n\r\nThere are other conditions which can be forwarded to interested parties."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The sites are situated off Father Russell Road in Dooradoyle, Limerick. The sites are accessed as you enter Abbey Court residential estate from Father Russell Road, and are on the right hand side just passed the entrance."
      },
      {
